  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;For the above reasons, the proposal is therefore NOT a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the lack of indication on the materials to be used in its exterior work or the visual appearance of said materials, has not demonstrated compliance with Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, Condition A.3(a) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:150%&quot;&gt;The proposed extension, by attaching to the existing single storey side extension, would result in a cumulative enlargement to the original dwellinghouse that would extend beyond a wall forming a side elevation of the original dwellinghouse and would have a width greater than half of the width of the original dwellinghouse. As such, the proposal would not comply with Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, Conditions A.1(j)(iii) and A.1(ja) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
